# Advisories accepted deliberately, each with a reason and an expiry. Trivy and the
# nightly patch decider both stop honouring an entry on its `exp:` date, read in UTC.
# The nightly reads the copy in the release tag it patches, so an entry here takes
# effect from the next release cut from main: a patch release keeps its tag's copy.

